{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/Library_Header_and_Header_Capsule.png?t=1742834038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leap into a 2.5D action platformer that takes inspiration from the iconic gameplay of the old-school <i>Prince of Persia</i> games, but upgrades it with a unique swashbuckling combat system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Keep your wits as sharp as your blade, for only the most heroic, dashing, and (most importantly) <i>stylish</i> of swordmasters will make it out alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/style_withHeader_thinner.png?t=1742834038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/steam_style.gif?t=1742834038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn style by fighting with flair - swing from chandeliers, trick enemies into attacking each other, kick bottles into your enemies, and any other clever maneuvers you can find. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then use your Style to dazzle your enemies with powerful special abilities, turning the tables on even the most powerful foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/labyrinthOfSecrets_withHeader.png?t=1742834038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/gif_labyrinth.gif?t=1742834038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level is designed to encourage exploration, with mysterious secrets hidden throughout. Paths are interwoven, and every twist and turn can reveal either a marvelous new surprise... or a deadly trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/changingDangers_withHeader.png?t=1742834038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/steam_changingDangers.gif?t=1742834038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every room of the Palace is a handcrafted work of art, but the dangers within will change each time you fail. You must stay on your toes if you are to survive its perils!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/taleWithinTale_withHeader.png?t=1742834038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/steam_taleWithinATale.gif?t=1742834038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are Rodrigo Al-Ahzab, a lowly beggar whose only aim is to survive in the streets of Granada. When you are pulled into a magical book, you learn that there are things that matter to you even more than your own survival\u2026\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Created by one of the writers behind <i>SpecOps: The Line</i>, this is a story with depths hidden behind the simple facade... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3330540?t=1742834038","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742834038","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/02d91ca137651a2be66141268c381f27a3d5a66d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742834038","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/02d91ca137651a2be66141268c381f27a3d5a66d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742834038","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/Library_Header_and_Header_Capsule.png?t=1742834038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leap into a 2.5D action platformer that takes inspiration from the iconic gameplay of the old-school <i>Prince of Persia</i> games, but upgrades it with a unique swashbuckling combat system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Keep your wits as sharp as your blade, for only the most heroic, dashing, and (most importantly) <i>stylish</i> of swordmasters will make it out alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/style_withHeader_thinner.png?t=1742834038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/steam_style.gif?t=1742834038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn style by fighting with flair - swing from chandeliers, trick enemies into attacking each other, kick bottles into your enemies, and any other clever maneuvers you can find. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then use your Style to dazzle your enemies with powerful special abilities, turning the tables on even the most powerful foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/labyrinthOfSecrets_withHeader.png?t=1742834038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/gif_labyrinth.gif?t=1742834038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level is designed to encourage exploration, with mysterious secrets hidden throughout. Paths are interwoven, and every twist and turn can reveal either a marvelous new surprise... or a deadly trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/changingDangers_withHeader.png?t=1742834038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/steam_changingDangers.gif?t=1742834038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every room of the Palace is a handcrafted work of art, but the dangers within will change each time you fail. You must stay on your toes if you are to survive its perils!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/taleWithinTale_withHeader.png?t=1742834038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/extras/steam_taleWithinATale.gif?t=1742834038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are Rodrigo Al-Ahzab, a lowly beggar whose only aim is to survive in the streets of Granada. When you are pulled into a magical book, you learn that there are things that matter to you even more than your own survival\u2026\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Created by one of the writers behind <i>SpecOps: The Line</i>, this is a story with depths hidden behind the simple facade... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Scruffy Dog Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330540/header.jpg?t=1742834038","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257099712,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099712/movie480.mp4?t=1742467556","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099712/movie_max.mp4?t=1742467556"},"name":"Narrated Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257099712/4144ca7c076eea21253da352469f0b9123b35352/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742467556","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099712/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742467556","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099712/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742467556"}}],"name":"Palace of a Thousand Curses","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 3.4 GHz, AMD Ryzen3 1200 3.1 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660 or AMD R9 270<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-6700 3.4 GHz, AMD Ryzen5 1600 3.2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 (4GB VRAM) or AMD Radeon RX 6300 (4GB VRAM)</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Scruffy Dog Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nViol\u00eancia","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":